tzi's Icon\nMetzi.png|Metzi\n\n== Trivia ==\n*Metzi is based off Metzi, the Aztec god of the moon.","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox Titan\n|image = File:Metzi.png\n|attack = 2\n|defense = 2\n|type = [[Meso-Titan]] Warrior\n|ability = Moon Mojo\n|first = [[TCG:SAS-087|SAS-087]]<br>[[Huntik TCG Tutorial|TCG Tutorial]]}}'''Metzi''' is [[Meso-Titan]] with a skull-like head decorated in a tribal headress. He is known to possess special Moon powers.\n\n== History ==\nMetzi was worshipped as a god of the moon by the ancient Aztecs. {{Source|TCG:SAS-087|SAS-087}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nMetzi's '''Moon Mojo''' ability allows his weaker allies to move more. He also appear to be armed with sharp claws.\n\n{{clear}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nMetzi_Icon.jpg|Metzi's Icon\nMetzi.png|Metzi\n</gallery>\n\n== Trivia ==\n*Metzi is based off [[:wikipedia:Metztli|Metzi]], the Aztec god of the moon.\n[[Category:Meso-Titans]]\n[[Category:Warrior Titans]]\n[[Category:Titans]]\n[[Category:TCG Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{MesoBox}}","categories":["Meso-Titans","TCG Titans","Titans","Warrior Titans"],"links":[{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"TCG:SAS-087","label":"SAS-087","target_id":"huntik:page:7464","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/TCG:SAS-087","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7464"},{"target_title":"Huntik TCG Tutorial","label":"TCG Tutorial","target_id":"huntik:page:25928","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_TCG_Tutorial","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A25928"},{"target_title":"Meso-Titan","label":"Meso-Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2834","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Meso-Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Meso-Titans"},{"target_title":"wikipedia:Metztli","label":"M